// Provenance S1: complement familial (CSS, livre V, titre II,
// chapitre II, plus livre VII, titre V, chapitre 5 DOM: L755-16/16-1,
// R755-1/2/3/4, D755-6/6-1). Block generated by tools/build_sources.py
// from the registry .scratch/reg-css.json (cut 2026-10-06; alineas
// and versions from the DILA LEGI mirror) plus three superseded
// metropolitan version XMLs from the mirror dump (old R522-2/R522-4
// with the arrete mechanism in the last alinea; old D522-2 with the
// 58,33 % majore rate). All DOM current versions cover the program
// window, so no DOM predecessor is pinned.
// Do not edit by hand.
//
// Coverage D-01 from 2021-01-01; the superseded versions cover the
// 2021-2022 windows (R522-2/R522-4 until 2022-10-29) and the
// January-March 2018 foreign window (D522-2 58,33 %). Editions run
// back to back from the earliest pinned debut; editions are monthly
// (shared YYYY-MM debuts form one edition at the earliest debut).
// NOTA joins the fragment only where it carries applicability
// (R522-3, D522-2); DOM NOTAs restate version debuts or pre-window
// history and stay outside fragments; see sources/articles.json.
