// L755-3): they arrive as case inputs with provenance. The yearly
// published ceilings (base, increments; D-83) are pinned in the blocks at
// the end of the file (sources/dss-plafonds/; tools/pin_plafonds_dss.py).
// The PASS arretes are pinned by the package fr.css.pass (D-84).

